14
01:06:18,947 --> 01:06:24,947
Dead Reckoning is a 2020 American action thriller
film directed by Andrzej Bartkowiak.

15
01:11:03,157 --> 01:11:09,157
The film stars KJ Apa, India Eisley, Scott Adkins and James Remar.

16
01:15:47,368 --> 01:15:53,368
It was released on video on demand on November 13, 2020.

17
01:20:31,578 --> 01:20:37,578
The film was shot in 2016, under the original title Altar Rock.

18
01:25:15,789 --> 01:25:21,789
The tone is lighthearted and dark and thought_provoking.
